WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.036
Bat woke up.

2
00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:22.381
He flew out of his cave.

3
00:00:22.382 --> 00:00:35.838
"I want bugs!" Bat said.

4
00:00:35.839 --> 00:00:38.138
"I will find bugs.

5
00:00:38.139 --> 00:00:42.654
And I will eat them!"

6
00:00:42.655 --> 00:00:49.402
Bat flew up in the sky.

7
00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:53.411
Bat flew over houses.

8
00:00:53.412 --> 00:00:56.665
He flew over trees.

9
00:00:56.666 --> 00:01:00.058
He found some big bugs.

10
00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:07.007
He found some little bugs.

11
00:01:07.008 --> 00:01:15.029
He ate and ate and ate.

12
00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:18.727
He flew and flew and flew.

13
00:01:18.728 --> 00:01:22.316
Bat was happy.

14
00:01:22.317 --> 00:01:26.638
"It's time to go home and sleep!"

15
00:01:26.639 --> 00:01:31.832
But now it was very dark.

16
00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:35.627
"Where is home?" Bat said.

17
00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:42.305
A big wind came up.

18
00:01:42.306 --> 00:01:48.844
A lot of rain came down.

19
00:01:48.845 --> 00:01:54.222
Bat was far from home.

